{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/a-worker-past-its-task-timeout-is-cut-and-read-as-timed-out",
  "title": "A worker still working past the Supervisor's task timeout is cut: its task ends cancelled, the call that delegated answers at once with the worker read as timed out, and the worker's one terminal status entry says so, naming its task; the supervisor's default bound on a call, shorter, does not cut a delegation",
  "rules": [
    "§19.7.3",
    "§23.3"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/orchestration/test_worker_delegation_bound.py test_a_worker_past_its_bound_is_cut_and_the_call_answers_once (the per-worker door); tests/orchestration/test_worker_run_task_line.py (timed out, inline); tests/tasks/test_cancelled_delegation.py test_a_supervisors_task_timeout_ends_the_task_cancelled. orchestration/_worker_run.py _delegate (answer_within, the timeout's text with :g); channels/_tool_registry.py orchestration_tool(..., waits=True) (RFC §21.6: a strategy's tool waits by design). The worker's model waits at a gate no step opens. The worker must reach its model gate before the bounded call ends. The 2 s budget includes database preparation; it is not a deadline on model work alone. Native tests expire bounds at a chosen boundary; the conformance timing regression delays preparation and keeps every expectation.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "sup",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Coordinator"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "c1",
                  "name": "delegate_to_researcher",
                  "arguments": {
                    "task": "Find the facts."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "It took too long."
            }
          ]
        },
        "tool_timeout_ms": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "researcher",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Researcher"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Too late.",
              "gate": "never"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "r1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "strategies": [
      {
        "id": "team",
        "supervisor": {
          "supervisor": "sup",
          "workers": [
            "researcher"
          ],
          "task_timeout_ms": 2000
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "install_strategy",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "strategy": "team"
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Find it."
        }
      },
      "background": true,
      "as": "delegation"
    },
    {
      "wait_for": "never"
    },
    {
      "await": "delegation",
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "status.recent",
      "agent_id": "researcher",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Find the facts."
          },
          {
            "status": "failed",
            "detail": "The task timed out after 2s.",
            "metadata": {
              "mode": "per_worker_wait",
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "r1": [
        {},
        {},
        {
          "type": "tool_call_end",
          "content": {
            "result": "{\"status\": \"failed\", \"worker\": \"researcher\", \"result\": \"The task timed out after 2s.\"}"
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sup",
            "channel_type": "ai"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "It took too long."
          },
          "chain_depth": 1,
          "responds_to": "r1#0"
        }
      ]
    },
    "rooms": {
      "$r1": {
        "metadata": {
          "task_agent_id": "researcher",
          "task_status": "cancelled",
          "task_result": null
        }
      }
    },
    "models": {
      "researcher": [
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "Find the facts."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sup": [
        {},
        {
          "tool_results": [
            {
              "tool_call_id": "c1",
              "content": "{\"status\": \"failed\", \"worker\": \"researcher\", \"result\": \"The task timed out after 2s.\"}",
              "is_error": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
